OL,4,CWorld Cup drove profits surge, says    
OL,5,CMarston's                              
OL,6,GPub company Marston's has said an      
OL,7,G"excellent World Cup" helped drive     
OL,8,Gstronger trading as annual profits     
OL,9,Grose by nearly a fifth, despite        
OL,10,Greporting a dip in sales.              
OL,12,FThe Wolverhampton-based firm, which    
OL,13,Foperates more than 1,300 pubs across   
OL,14,Fthe UK, reported underlying pre-tax    
OL,15,Fprofits of #85.4m for the year to 26   
OL,16,FSeptember, up 18.4% from a year        
OL,17,Fearlier.                               
